@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff

title 媒体面数据流：一路视频如何从主播到观众

participant "主播浏览器" as A
participant "Transport\n(Pion WebRTC)" as PT
participant "Buffer\nbuffer/buffer.go" as BUF
participant "UpTrack\nsfu/uplink" as UP
participant "Forwarder\nsfu/forwarder.go" as FW
participant "DownTrack\nsfu/downtrack.go" as DT
participant "订阅者 Transport" as ST
participant "观众浏览器" as V

== 上行 ==
A -> PT : SRTP 视频包 (UDP 7882)
PT -> BUF : 解 SRTP → RTP
BUF -> BUF : 环形缓冲 +\n丢包统计/NACK 生成
BUF -> UP : 读取最新包
UP -> FW : RTP 包 + 分层信息
note over FW : 不解码！只改包头
== 下行（按订阅者） ==
FW -> DT : 重写 SN/TS/SSRC\n按选定清晰度抽层
DT -> ST : SRTP 加密写 UDP
ST -> V : 渲染
== 反向控制 ==
V --> DT : RTCP RR (接收质量)
DT --> FW : 上行反馈 TWCC/REMB
FW --> A : 码率自适应
DT --> UP : NACK 重传请求
UP --> BUF : 从缓冲重取丢失包
BUF --> A : 重传 (RTX 流)
note over BUF, DT : 关键：服务器只做\n「选路 + 包头重写 + 缓冲重传」\n全程不碰视频编码
@enduml
